.TH "GYRO" "1" "Nov 2026" "Gyro Hosting" "gyro manual"

.SH NAME
gyro-server-ip-remove - Release an additional IPv4 address


.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBgyro server ip remove   [flags]\fP


.SH DESCRIPTION
Release an additional IPv4 address

.PP
\fBMinimum charge:\fP each added IP is billed for at least 6 hours (\fBpricing.minimum_hours\fR): releasing it earlier still bills the minimum (debited at release), and taking the same address again starts a new minimum. At most \fBadds_per_hour\fR addresses (default 10) can be added to a server per 60 minutes. The address is removed from the server and returns to the pool (getting the same address back is not guaranteed); billing stops at release (the minimum still applies). Needs \fBconfirm=true\fR\&.

.PP
API: DELETE /cloud/servers/{id}/ips/{ip} (operationId removeServerIp, scope cloud_write)


.SH OPTIONS
\fB--dry-run\fP[=false]
	show the price quote / request without changing anything

.PP
\fB-h\fP, \fB--help\fP[=false]
	help for remove

.PP
